;; A ledger with a commodity that has no price at any date (vacation hours).
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash USD
2024-01-01 open Assets:Leave VACHR
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food USD
2024-01-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances USD,VACHR

2024-01-01 * "Opening" "Seed the cash account"
  Assets:Cash              1000.00 USD
  Equity:Opening-Balances  -1000.00 USD

2024-01-15 * "Grant" "Vacation hours"
  Assets:Leave             8 VACHR
  Equity:Opening-Balances  -8 VACHR

2024-02-01 * "Grocer" "Groceries"
  Expenses:Food   45.00 USD
  Assets:Cash    -45.00 USD
